'''''Punklorde Mentality''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Stellaron Hunters (Companion Mission Chapter)|Stellaron Hunters]].

==Steps==
# Go to base zone to answer the call
# Go toward the elevator entrance and see who the important guest is
# Go and wait at the elevator entrance and see who the important guest is
# Talk to the Distressed Worker
# Investigate the suspicious graffiti
# Track Silver Wolf's path of infiltration
# Continue to track Silver Wolf's infiltration pathway
# Continue to track Silver Wolf's infiltration path
# Head to the Curio Collection Room at the other end
# Investigate the suspicious graffiti
# Head to the main control room
# Talk with Leonard
# (Optional) Find other clues left by Silver Wolf

